18:["$","p","p-3",{"children":["Imagine a company named ",["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"ShopEasy"}],". It has an online shopping application. Customers open the website, search products, add items to their cart, and place orders."]}]
19:["$","p","p-4",{"children":"The application may look fine one minute and become slow the next minute. The database may become unreachable. The server may run out of memory. A container may stop. Users may start receiving HTTP 500 errors."}]
1a:["$","p","p-5",{"children":["$","strong","strong-0",{"children":"The DevOps Engineer's job is not only to deploy the application. The engineer also needs to understand whether it is healthy, notice problems quickly, investigate the cause, and help restore the service."}]}]
